Selection sort below is run on `a = [47, 22, 13, 58, 31, 9, 40, 26]`. After exactly **3 passes** (3 iterations of the outer loop), which value is at **1-based position 4**?

```python
for i in range(len(a) - 1):
    m = i
    for j in range(i + 1, len(a)):
        if a[j] < a[m]:
            m = j
    a[i], a[m] = a[m], a[i]
```
